@title: form_free_plan
@context: A sign-up on the free plan, from Ukraine, with the newsletter.
@tags: form
@import: * from '../lib/env.hunt'

STEP 1: Open the sign-up form
    NAVIGATE to 'Signup'
    VERIFY that the page is 'Signup'

STEP 2: Full name
    FILL 'Full name' field with 'Ada Lovelace'
    VERIFY 'Full name' field has value 'Ada Lovelace'

STEP 3: Email
    FILL 'Email' field with 'ada@example.com'
    VERIFY 'Email' field has value 'ada@example.com'

STEP 4: Phone, typed
    TYPE '+380 44 000 0000' into the 'Phone' field
    VERIFY 'Phone' field has value '+380 44 000 0000'

STEP 5: Country
    SELECT 'Ukraine' from the 'Country' dropdown
    VERIFY 'Country' field has value 'Ukraine'

STEP 6: Accept the terms
    CHECK the checkbox for 'I accept the Terms'
    VERIFY that 'Create account' is enabled

STEP 7: Create the account
    CLICK the 'Create account' button
    VERIFY that 'Thanks, Ada Lovelace! Plan: free, country: Ukraine, newsletter: yes' is present

DONE.
